WEBVTT

00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:02.890
You're in the way; please prostrate yourselves and capisce.

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:05.400
We're gonna win this thing.

00:00:07.570 --> 00:00:10.240
Let's go, NonSugar!

00:00:10.890 --> 00:00:12.070
Verily.

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:13.530
Go for it!

00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:13.780
Pri!

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:15.430
Of course!
Leave it to us-ucha!

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:18.990
<i>To think that the Chiri outside PriPara would defy me.</i>

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:24.200
<i>But I'm certain the Chiri within PriPara and I will see eye to eye.</i>

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:30.260
Um, so I was talking big in front of everyone,

00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:32.830
but for the Divine Idol Grand Prix this time around,

00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:36.340
all the teams have really polished their Making Dramas-usa!

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:39.890
NonSugar can't win at our current level-ucha!

00:00:39.890 --> 00:00:41.100
What?

00:00:41.530 --> 00:00:44.850
So we've gotta create a new Making Drama right now,

00:00:44.870 --> 00:00:47.440
no rehearsals, and enter with it-ucha!

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:49.040
Right now?

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:51.250
But there isn't even any more time...

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:52.200
Yes, there is-ucha!

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:52.860
Huh?

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:55.150
There's still four more teams to go-ucha!

00:00:55.550 --> 00:00:57.120
Seriously?

00:02:34.910 --> 00:02:37.570
Do not panic.

00:02:38.270 --> 00:02:39.220
Janice?

00:02:42.160 --> 00:02:45.180
I approve of Usacha's idea.

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:47.890
Wait, Janice, you followed us? You don't know when to give up!

00:02:48.230 --> 00:02:53.860
After entering PriPara, Chiri will have regained
her strong heart, and she'll listen to me. I'm certain of it.

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:57.400
I will say again.

00:02:57.400 --> 00:03:00.530
I came here to remind you of your higher purpose.

00:03:01.020 --> 00:03:05.720
You must triumph, and then,
before returning the baton to Onee-sama.

00:03:05.720 --> 00:03:07.550
give it to me.

00:03:08.550 --> 00:03:10.250
What are you talking about-ucha?

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:13.630
Janice.

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:17.720
Even after entering PriPara,
I'm unable to accord with you.

00:03:17.720 --> 00:03:18.920
Chiri!

00:03:19.440 --> 00:03:21.970
I could not steal the baton,

00:03:21.970 --> 00:03:26.100
not even for the sake of PriPara's rules –
for justice, as you claim.

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:27.430
And more importantly,

00:03:28.160 --> 00:03:31.390
I could not so cast aside my own pride.

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:32.700
Ooh-ooh!

00:03:32.700 --> 00:03:34.190
Well said, Chiri!

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:39.210
I can't believe you're speaking on
the same level as those commoner idols.

00:03:39.640 --> 00:03:41.340
It seems I misjudged you.

00:03:41.340 --> 00:03:42.660
I wonder.

00:03:43.050 --> 00:03:47.920
As I see it, I've been able to make some trustworthy companions with whom I can better myself.

00:03:47.920 --> 00:03:51.000
If anything, I should hold my head higher than ever before.

00:03:51.840 --> 00:03:53.000
Chiri!

00:03:53.440 --> 00:03:59.560
If you're so very sure, then not till heaven should fall shall I guide you again.

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:02.180
I've no longer any use for you.

00:04:03.630 --> 00:04:06.500
Janice-san! We don't have any more time!

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:08.490
So please leave us to it-ucha!

00:04:08.490 --> 00:04:08.970
Eek!

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:10.480
Hey! No! Let me go!

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:12.190
Let you go!

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:16.400
Oh, why must I be treated like this?

00:04:17.160 --> 00:04:20.110
I want to grow up quickly!

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:23.560
You just wait! I'm not giving up so easily!

00:04:24.600 --> 00:04:28.620
I shall not give up my ambitions!

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:31.080
Thank you, Japan!

00:04:31.680 --> 00:04:34.580
One team's already finished their performance-ucha!

00:04:35.010 --> 00:04:38.040
We're running out of time-ucha!

00:04:40.180 --> 00:04:41.840
Okay, then let's do this!

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:42.840
Non.

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:43.970
Non!

00:04:44.420 --> 00:04:49.380
I mean, it's thanks to Usacha that
the three of us became a team in the first place!

00:04:49.380 --> 00:04:51.620
You worked hard, too, Non.

00:04:51.620 --> 00:04:52.660
Well, so did you.

00:04:52.660 --> 00:04:53.940
Me too!

00:04:54.530 --> 00:04:56.720
It sure wasn't easy,

00:04:56.720 --> 00:04:58.660
finally becoming a real team.

00:04:58.660 --> 00:05:00.610
It's worthy of a PriPara world record-ucha!

00:05:00.610 --> 00:05:03.170
But it's allowed us to strengthen our bonds all the more.

00:05:03.170 --> 00:05:04.400
Chiri!

00:05:04.740 --> 00:05:08.320
Okay! We've come all this way,
so we may as well... no.

00:05:08.950 --> 00:05:13.580
We <i>have</i> to give it everything we've got!

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:15.480
We're gonna win this!

00:05:15.480 --> 00:05:16.110
Win!

00:05:16.110 --> 00:05:17.040
Count me in!

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:18.620
NonSugar...

00:05:18.620 --> 00:05:20.710
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:05:20.710 --> 00:05:22.170
Ucha!

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:26.680
This show's rolling, rolling, Dalí-darling along-Da Vinci!

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:30.140
Heart-pounding, floor-stamping and cosmic!

00:05:30.140 --> 00:05:31.100
Kyu–Kyu–Kyu–Kyu–Kyu–Kyu–Kyu....

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:33.560
Kyupikon!

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:38.650
Okay, but I can't think of an idea just like that.

00:05:39.590 --> 00:05:43.420
That reminds me, I arranged some food for luck!

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:44.740
Ooh!

00:05:45.450 --> 00:05:48.990
Chicken cutlets to ensure we're a cut above the rest!

00:05:48.990 --> 00:05:50.980
Laughing fish taiyaki...

00:05:50.980 --> 00:05:52.200
So we'll laugh all the way to the finish!

00:05:52.900 --> 00:05:55.480
Natto wrapped up in the shape of the kanji for "one"...

00:05:55.480 --> 00:05:57.420
So we'll wrap it up with first-place!

00:05:57.690 --> 00:06:00.380
And a pork cutlet bowl cause we're on a roll!

00:06:00.670 --> 00:06:03.090
Hey, those are just feeble puns!

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:04.300
Your Highness!

00:06:04.680 --> 00:06:07.760
Hey, we don't have time to capisce!

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:09.000
Licky-slurp!

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:12.560
She ate it all by herself?

00:06:12.920 --> 00:06:14.670
Rule of Sapanna!

00:06:14.670 --> 00:06:16.150
Eating is a race!

00:06:16.150 --> 00:06:19.640
Come on, Pepper, we need you to bring up ideas!

00:06:21.010 --> 00:06:22.940
Bring up burp!

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:24.480
We don't need that!

00:06:25.920 --> 00:06:26.990
For Heaven's sake...

00:06:27.620 --> 00:06:30.700
I never imagined she'd be so useless!

00:06:31.020 --> 00:06:35.090
At any rate, NonSugar stands no chance of victory.

00:06:35.560 --> 00:06:39.670
I'll abandon that plan.
Now I have to find a replacement for Chiri.

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:42.130
Garmageddon.

00:06:43.200 --> 00:06:44.920
You're Janice, are you not?

00:06:44.920 --> 00:06:46.580
She's flying-garu!

00:06:46.580 --> 00:06:47.760
I'm so surpriseded!

00:06:48.640 --> 00:06:52.890
Garmageddon. There is something vital I must speak of with you.

00:06:53.390 --> 00:06:55.430
What?

00:06:55.720 --> 00:06:57.770
A spine-tingling fright – here we go!

00:06:58.420 --> 00:07:01.020
Are you still speaking of such things?

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:02.520
Janice, you're being naughty!

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:04.640
You're all mixed up and wrong!

00:07:04.640 --> 00:07:06.490
I am not wrong!

00:07:06.490 --> 00:07:08.990
I aim to benefit PriPara!

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:10.050
Hmm.

00:07:10.410 --> 00:07:13.340
That babe is an ally of the Devil.

00:07:13.340 --> 00:07:16.120
Thus, Hell is a fitting abode her for her.

00:07:16.940 --> 00:07:17.580
So...

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:21.290
She's saying the baton belongs to Jululu,
so we won't give it to you!

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:26.130
You speak in riddles! I'll happily set that straight!

00:07:26.130 --> 00:07:28.620
Don't be like that! Let's play together!

00:07:28.620 --> 00:07:31.340
Wow! That looks fun! Garuru wants to do it too-garu!

00:07:33.440 --> 00:07:37.460
You accursed... how dare you handle a goddess's sister so!

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:43.650
Dressing Pafé. There is something vital I must speak of with you.

00:07:43.650 --> 00:07:44.710
Huh?

00:07:45.140 --> 00:07:47.820
Usa! S–Steal a goddess's baton?

00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:51.780
Nope, no way. We're Jululu's friends, ya know.

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:55.490
Have you tried just talking to Jululu?

00:07:55.800 --> 00:07:57.890
The foe of Jululu is my foe!

00:07:57.890 --> 00:07:59.620
Good is rewarded and evil punished!

00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:08.170
Jululu sure looks cheerful.

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:11.670
I'm sure she's delighted there are so many idols com-pri-ting.

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:14.840
Seeing little Jululu laugh warms the heart, doesn't it-kuma?

00:08:15.520 --> 00:08:17.400
This room...

00:08:17.400 --> 00:08:19.220
is better left alone.

00:08:19.220 --> 00:08:22.270
Listen to them, unaware of my suffering!

00:08:24.550 --> 00:08:28.900
What ails you so, sister to a goddess, Janice?

00:08:29.250 --> 00:08:33.300
You are Shikyouin Hibiki of Tricolore.

00:08:33.300 --> 00:08:35.870
It is an honour for my humble self to be remembered.

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:38.830
So you know of me?

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:40.490
But of course.

00:08:40.490 --> 00:08:42.720
And of the goddess Jewlie, as well.

00:08:42.720 --> 00:08:43.540
That day,

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:47.820
you two goddesses captured my interest.

00:08:47.820 --> 00:08:50.030
And I could not but take a peek.

00:08:52.410 --> 00:08:56.430
Are you able to uphold PriPara's rules?

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:58.520
I must say I'm disinclined.

00:08:58.520 --> 00:09:02.770
I'm only interested in upholding the rules which benefit me.

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:05.520
Oh! Then why even appear before me?

00:09:06.050 --> 00:09:10.060
I simply wished to observe the sister of a goddess in person.

00:09:10.060 --> 00:09:11.540
Oh, is that so?

00:09:11.540 --> 00:09:15.640
You'll regret not lending me your assistance later!

00:09:15.640 --> 00:09:20.740
For Heaven's sake! Why does my sister countenance such arrogant idols?

00:09:21.400 --> 00:09:26.420
Every one of these idols is flawed, incapable of understanding my reasoning!

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:28.920
Then so be it.

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:30.390
I've no other choice...

00:09:35.210 --> 00:09:36.300
We've got to hurry-ucha!

00:09:36.740 --> 00:09:40.260
Once the third team finishes their performance, that's it-ucha!

00:09:40.260 --> 00:09:41.980
I know that!

00:09:41.980 --> 00:09:43.870
But I can't think of anything.

00:09:43.870 --> 00:09:48.350
I'm at my wit's end! We already had a Making Drama about flowers...

00:09:48.350 --> 00:09:52.270
And we created one with inspiration from the deserted island, as well.

00:09:52.270 --> 00:09:55.090
What else can we think of?

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:57.200
Do you have any ideas, Pepper?

00:09:57.200 --> 00:09:58.780
Want to eat dessert!

00:09:58.780 --> 00:10:00.910
Will you be serious and try for a minute?

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:02.090
That's it!

00:10:02.090 --> 00:10:03.240
What is?

00:10:03.570 --> 00:10:08.310
I've heard said that sweet things spur brain activity!

00:10:08.310 --> 00:10:10.170
So let's all eat dessert together!

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:12.930
Are you serious? Dessert at a time like th–

00:10:12.930 --> 00:10:14.120
Okay-ucha!

00:10:14.120 --> 00:10:16.420
I'll get a victory-bringing dessert ready-ucha!

00:10:16.420 --> 00:10:17.630
Seriously?

00:10:18.540 --> 00:10:21.600
Super chanko singing-chanko!

00:10:24.220 --> 00:10:25.200
Woo-hoo!

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:25.980
Eat dessert!

00:10:27.850 --> 00:10:28.810
Hey!

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:30.400
And... catch!

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:32.310
Chiri-shan-shan!

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:34.820
Ucha!

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:39.250
Ucha...

00:10:39.610 --> 00:10:41.410
And somehow we're safe.

00:10:42.140 --> 00:10:43.010
Oh.

00:10:43.010 --> 00:10:45.910
It's mixed-up and not too pretty,

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:49.560
but by working together,
you three completed the cake-ucha!

00:10:49.560 --> 00:10:50.920
That's amazing-ucha!

00:10:51.190 --> 00:10:53.630
It's the first thing you've created as a team-ucha!

00:10:53.980 --> 00:10:56.150
But it's still a total mess.

00:10:56.150 --> 00:10:57.520
What a pity.

00:10:57.520 --> 00:10:58.350
Gonna eat!

00:10:58.350 --> 00:11:00.090
Would you refrain?

00:11:00.480 --> 00:11:03.260
Hey, Chiri, you just touched Pepper of your own accord.

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:05.510
That's a miracle in itself-ucha!

00:11:11.190 --> 00:11:14.610
Could the members of NonSugar get ready to go on standby, please?

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:15.700
Wait...!

00:11:15.700 --> 00:11:18.330
Hey, what? We're out of time?

00:11:23.400 --> 00:11:24.960
What about the Making Drama?

00:11:24.960 --> 00:11:26.700
We've gotta use one of our current ones!

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:27.490
Ooh-ooh!
Really?

00:11:28.380 --> 00:11:30.990
Non, Chiri, Pepper.

00:11:31.360 --> 00:11:34.920
You've come so far, now just have fun out there-ucha.

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:36.000
Huh?

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:40.420
If you can all go out and smile,
that's all that matters-ucha!

00:11:41.440 --> 00:11:42.640
Yeah!

00:11:44.580 --> 00:11:47.100
If no one will take it for me,

00:11:48.240 --> 00:11:50.550
then before it's given to an idol,

00:11:50.910 --> 00:11:53.540
I must take it with my own hands!

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:04.630
This team coord's key feature are the colourful polka dots.

00:12:04.630 --> 00:12:08.750
Accented on the chest and skirt with heart-shaped jewels!

00:12:08.750 --> 00:12:10.500
NonSugar Coord!

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:10.940
Non!

00:12:10.940 --> 00:12:11.300
Chiri!

00:12:11.300 --> 00:12:12.500
Ooh-ooh!

00:12:12.810 --> 00:12:14.460
NonSugar! You're gonna win it!

00:12:15.050 --> 00:12:20.260
We've reached the final entrants of the fourth Divine Idol Grand Prix!

00:12:20.600 --> 00:12:24.180
Here they are, aiming to topple the current elite:

00:12:24.700 --> 00:12:25.840
NonSugar!

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:26.980
Non-chan!

00:12:26.980 --> 00:12:27.980
Chiri-chan, I love you!

00:12:27.980 --> 00:12:28.850
Pepper!

00:12:28.850 --> 00:12:30.810
Non, go for it!

00:12:30.810 --> 00:12:32.380
Break a leg!

00:12:32.380 --> 00:12:34.270
Go for it-garu!

00:12:34.550 --> 00:12:36.490
Thanks for waiting!

00:12:36.490 --> 00:12:38.690
We're NonSugar, everyone!

00:12:38.690 --> 00:12:41.990
Every last one of you, prostrate yourselves and capisce!

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:44.950
Everyone licky-stick! We're all idols!

00:12:44.950 --> 00:12:48.910
Don't presume we're the same as always.

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:50.980
We're gonna sing now, better than ever.

00:12:50.980 --> 00:12:52.200
So here it is!

00:12:52.920 --> 00:12:55.170
"Sugarless×Friend"!

00:13:22.710 --> 00:13:25.400
<i>I don't like admitting it, but it's like Janice said.</i>

00:13:25.400 --> 00:13:28.530
<i>Even if our dancing's not perfect, we should be free!</i>

00:13:29.040 --> 00:13:32.870
<i>Steps, mostly in time! Mum, are you watching?</i>

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:35.210
<i>Higher, faster!</i>

00:13:52.790 --> 00:13:55.230
<i>It's the first thing you've created as a team-ucha!</i>

00:13:56.060 --> 00:13:57.810
<i>Even if it's not perfect, we should loosen up.</i>

00:13:57.810 --> 00:13:59.360
<i>Even if it's not perfect!</i>

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:03.980
<i>Hey, that's it: the cake we all made together!</i>

00:14:04.260 --> 00:14:04.940
<i>Chiri!</i>

00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:07.650
<i>Indeed. Even if it's not picturesque.</i>

00:14:07.650 --> 00:14:08.610
<i>Pepper!</i>

00:14:08.610 --> 00:14:10.570
<i>Okay! Ooh-ooh!</i>

00:14:10.570 --> 00:14:12.580
<i>Yep! Let's do it – no rehearsals!</i>

00:14:12.580 --> 00:14:15.870
Making Drama, switch on!

00:14:16.320 --> 00:14:17.830
Here we go!

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:19.460
By working together!

00:14:20.410 --> 00:14:21.460
Fluffy!

00:14:23.390 --> 00:14:24.380
Tropical!

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:27.340
Rich!

00:14:28.600 --> 00:14:30.090
Now on sale!

00:14:30.620 --> 00:14:32.520
The PriPara sweet:

00:14:33.650 --> 00:14:35.390
Fluffy Tropical-Rich!

00:14:36.600 --> 00:14:38.060
Ucha!

00:14:38.060 --> 00:14:42.270
They created a Making Drama in that brief window?

00:14:42.270 --> 00:14:45.360
Super Cyalume Change!

00:14:52.030 --> 00:14:52.620
Non!

00:14:52.620 --> 00:14:53.020
Chiri!

00:14:53.020 --> 00:14:54.160
Ooh-ooh!

00:15:27.970 --> 00:15:29.950
Non-chan, you're the loveliest!

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:31.660
Cleanse me in your shan-shan dance!

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:33.870
Pepper! Licky-stick me!

00:15:40.710 --> 00:15:43.170
Usacha! Usa! Usa!

00:15:43.800 --> 00:15:45.130
We did it!

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:45.720
Indeed.

00:15:45.720 --> 00:15:46.590
Yeah!

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:48.250
You were fantastic-ucha!

00:15:48.250 --> 00:15:50.870
You really gave it everything you had-ucha!

00:15:50.870 --> 00:15:53.090
There's nothing else to say-ucha!

00:15:53.090 --> 00:15:54.790
NonSugar, you're so cute!

00:15:54.790 --> 00:15:54.980
Magnificent...
NonSugar, you're so cute!

00:15:54.980 --> 00:15:56.620
Magnificent...

00:15:57.020 --> 00:16:01.630
Such teamwork, creating
a Making Drama in that brief window.

00:16:01.630 --> 00:16:03.520
And furthermore,

00:16:03.520 --> 00:16:06.360
Non's steps were bigger!

00:16:06.360 --> 00:16:09.560
Pepper was finally in step with everyone!

00:16:09.560 --> 00:16:11.080
And Chiri!

00:16:11.080 --> 00:16:14.180
That was the best performance Chiri's given yet!

00:16:15.230 --> 00:16:17.880
You've all grown so much!

00:16:17.880 --> 00:16:20.290
This performance was a victory in itself!

00:16:21.940 --> 00:16:23.790
But then, I...

00:16:23.790 --> 00:16:25.610
Announcing the results!

00:16:25.610 --> 00:16:27.750
The winner is NonSugar!

00:16:29.040 --> 00:16:32.470
Would intrude upon their victory performance?

00:16:32.470 --> 00:16:32.820
We did it!

00:16:32.820 --> 00:16:34.440
We truly did it!
We did it!

00:16:34.440 --> 00:16:34.920
We did it!

00:16:35.200 --> 00:16:36.980
NonSugar's toppled the elite!

00:16:36.980 --> 00:16:39.430
Congratulations, NonSugar!

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:41.940
Come, Divine Closet!

00:16:41.940 --> 00:16:44.810
Show me your greatest performance!

00:16:45.660 --> 00:16:46.960
I couldn't!

00:16:48.100 --> 00:16:50.060
Divine Idol Grand Prix...

00:16:50.840 --> 00:16:51.990
Onee-sama!

00:16:51.990 --> 00:16:53.200
The baton...

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:55.040
Switch on!

00:16:55.040 --> 00:16:56.160
The baton!

00:16:57.960 --> 00:16:59.490
I can't.

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:02.960
But what is this feeling stopping me?

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:08.040
Ooh-ooh!

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:11.010
Divine Jewel, Cyalume Jewel Mic!

00:17:12.180 --> 00:17:16.250
Let the challenge commence...
to become a Divine Idol!

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:44.540
I bestow upon you a coord fit for a Divine Idol...

00:17:44.540 --> 00:17:46.210
The Divine Tops!

00:17:46.230 --> 00:17:47.670
Take it, o worthy idol.

00:17:47.680 --> 00:17:50.370
Open, Divine Closet!

00:17:55.120 --> 00:17:56.700
Finally, at long last,

00:17:56.700 --> 00:18:00.190
the final Divine Coord, the Divine Tops, has been freed!

00:18:11.860 --> 00:18:13.320
Oh... Kuma...

00:18:19.660 --> 00:18:22.700
NonSugar, congratulations!

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:23.650
Yay!

00:18:23.650 --> 00:18:25.020
Thank you, everyone!

00:18:25.020 --> 00:18:26.580
Thank you kindly!

00:18:26.820 --> 00:18:29.580
Way to go-ucha! This is the best day ever-ucha!

00:18:29.580 --> 00:18:31.610
It's all thanks to you, Usacha!

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:32.590
Thank you!

00:18:32.590 --> 00:18:34.070
Congratulations, Non!

00:18:34.070 --> 00:18:35.380
Thanks, Onee-chan!

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:37.340
It's kinda galling, but you were pri-ncredible!

00:18:37.340 --> 00:18:39.300
You were all very lovely!

00:18:39.300 --> 00:18:41.230
Simply splendiferous.

00:18:41.230 --> 00:18:43.010
Your dancing was light and sparkling!

00:18:43.010 --> 00:18:45.470
They toppled us elites!

00:18:46.420 --> 00:18:50.690
Through spring, summer, autumn and winter, this has been a hard-fought competition.

00:18:51.400 --> 00:18:54.400
The final Divine Idol Grand Prix is over.

00:18:56.830 --> 00:19:00.030
Inscribed on the plate are the names of the victors:

00:19:00.030 --> 00:19:01.340
SoLaMi SMILE,

00:19:01.340 --> 00:19:02.750
Dressing Pafé,

00:19:02.750 --> 00:19:03.900
Garmageddon,

00:19:03.900 --> 00:19:04.980
Tricolore,

00:19:04.980 --> 00:19:06.040
and NonSugar.

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:11.420
These five teams will now enter a tournament to determine who can become a Divine Idol.

00:19:12.170 --> 00:19:16.590
They can enter the Divine Idol Grand Prix final!

00:19:17.190 --> 00:19:19.090
The Divine Idol Grand Prix final?

00:19:19.400 --> 00:19:21.010
And if we win that...

00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:22.430
We can become...

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:23.550
Divine Idols!

00:19:25.110 --> 00:19:28.770
A message from Miss Jewlie has been delivered.

00:19:30.160 --> 00:19:31.680
"Hello, all!"

00:19:31.680 --> 00:19:35.270
"Thank you all for entering in this final Grand Prix!"

00:19:35.820 --> 00:19:38.340
"It made me very happy."

00:19:38.340 --> 00:19:43.930
"I have a present for all those who entered,
as a token of my gratitude."

00:19:44.220 --> 00:19:45.490
... Is what it says.

00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:49.410
Cosmic!

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:50.330
Oh.

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:54.790
This PriTicket's for a black-and-white Mystery Coord-garu!

00:19:55.090 --> 00:19:56.750
Fantastic!

00:19:57.130 --> 00:19:58.500
And with that said...

00:19:58.500 --> 00:20:00.360
Merry Christmas!

00:20:00.360 --> 00:20:02.680
As Christmas present from Miss Jewlie,

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:02.920
Last-Chance Rematch Tournament

00:20:02.920 --> 00:20:05.010
A Last-Chance Rematch Tournament will be held!

00:20:05.010 --> 00:20:08.440
Those who lost narrowly in this competition...

00:20:08.440 --> 00:20:11.690
Why, with that PriTicket, you too can enter!

00:20:12.140 --> 00:20:13.150
Seriously?

00:20:13.150 --> 00:20:13.650
All right!

00:20:13.660 --> 00:20:14.650
Chanko!

00:20:18.500 --> 00:20:21.380
Distributing rarities willy-nilly again.

00:20:21.380 --> 00:20:23.550
And this "Last-Chance Rematch Tournament"...

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:27.420
Why do you seek to disturb the order of PriPara so?

00:20:27.420 --> 00:20:31.330
This would be the first Divine Idols to be born in PriPara since the Saints!

00:20:32.110 --> 00:20:36.500
Please do give it your utmost
in order to fulfil this great honour!

00:20:37.350 --> 00:20:40.890
Capisce!

00:20:44.120 --> 00:20:46.390
I wonder if Usacha's in here?

00:20:46.390 --> 00:20:48.720
Congratulations, Chiri, all of you.

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:49.060
Oh!

00:20:49.060 --> 00:20:50.100
Janice!

00:20:50.100 --> 00:20:51.930
Then you saw our performance?

00:20:52.360 --> 00:20:53.550
I did.

00:20:53.550 --> 00:20:56.240
It was quite... well...

00:20:56.720 --> 00:20:57.900
You did well.

00:20:57.900 --> 00:20:59.610
Janice!

00:21:00.750 --> 00:21:02.860
That's the first compliment you've given us!

00:21:02.860 --> 00:21:04.070
All right, licky-stick!

00:21:04.640 --> 00:21:06.240
So the baton...

00:21:06.960 --> 00:21:09.390
I had decided to steal it myself.

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:13.710
But your performance had me transfixed, and I could not.

00:21:14.810 --> 00:21:17.110
So you understand what we said?

00:21:17.110 --> 00:21:19.640
No, they are different matters.

00:21:19.640 --> 00:21:24.130
The felicity of PriPara hangs in the balance: I could hardly give up on the baton.

00:21:24.620 --> 00:21:26.420
You're really not giving up?

00:21:26.420 --> 00:21:27.770
Of course not.

00:21:27.770 --> 00:21:32.840
And that being so, we've no choice but to follow our own different paths.

00:21:32.840 --> 00:21:34.180
Janice...

00:21:34.530 --> 00:21:35.680
Chiri.

00:21:35.680 --> 00:21:37.610
Today is farewell.

00:21:37.610 --> 00:21:38.900
Thank you for your care all this time.

00:21:40.380 --> 00:21:41.460
Wait.

00:21:42.180 --> 00:21:44.320
Do you think I'll let you leave like that?

00:21:44.320 --> 00:21:46.150
We're all a team together!

00:21:46.150 --> 00:21:48.240
That's no longer possible.

00:21:48.560 --> 00:21:52.480
Janice! We were following your advice back then!

00:21:52.480 --> 00:21:54.660
Indeed! It served us very well!

00:21:54.660 --> 00:21:55.540
Yeah!

00:22:01.620 --> 00:22:03.420
NonSugar...

00:22:03.420 --> 00:22:06.540
Congratulations on your Grand Prix victory-ucha.

00:22:06.540 --> 00:22:07.630
It's time at last.

00:22:08.420 --> 00:22:10.980
The evening sun sets on my life-ucha.

00:22:12.760 --> 00:22:16.330
No breaking Sapanna rules!

00:22:16.330 --> 00:22:19.440
After the festival comes feast!

00:23:52.060 --> 00:23:54.500
Usacha! I'm so happy for y-usa!

00:23:54.500 --> 00:23:57.540
Your NonSugar winning the Grand Prix makes your big brother's heart swell-usa!

00:23:57.540 --> 00:23:59.540
This isn't the time!

00:23:59.540 --> 00:24:00.700
What's going on-usa?

00:24:00.700 --> 00:24:05.200
Usacha made a promise that if we won
the Grand Prix together, Pepper could eat her!

00:24:05.200 --> 00:24:06.710
Wh–Wh–What did you say?

00:24:06.710 --> 00:24:08.550
Oh, where have they got to?

00:24:08.550 --> 00:24:09.760
Are they getting ready now?

00:24:09.760 --> 00:24:10.380
<i>No</i>!

00:24:10.380 --> 00:24:12.430
You can't-usa! You can't-usa!
We have to look for Usacha

00:24:12.430 --> 00:24:14.710
and save her from Pepper-usa!

00:24:14.710 --> 00:24:17.090
Next time, <i>Farewell, Usacha...</i>

00:24:17.090 --> 00:24:19.980
Aim to be a Divine Idol! Let's go, PriPara!
